  <biography>k__BackingField: "The firstborn daughter of the Bloodrose family. After
    her father\u2019s death, she took over the family business. However, she never
    married, and the Bloodrose line ended with her."
  <souvenirData>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9445aa4f19727c1499a6df95d5250517, type: 2}
  <souvenirNote>k__BackingField: "\u201CYou once said the night would never end.\r\nBut
    you were wrong - \r\nIt ends the moment someone dares to light a candle.\r\n\r\nYou
    were my light.\u201D\r\n\r\nThere is also short note on the back:\r\n\r\n\u201CLove
    ~\r\nEven when the world forbiddeth it.\r\nFor love alone is the law worth breaking.\u201D\r\n"
